{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地影壇盛事《第39屆電影金雞獎》頒獎典禮暨閉幕式將於明晚假廈門舉行，今日大會率先舉行提名者表彰儀式，有份角逐「最佳男主角」的梁家輝、檀健次、吳磊、蔣龍及蔣奇明共聚一堂，梁家輝更與電影《捕風追影》的拍檔、有份爭奪「最佳男配角」的此沙手拖手行</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:43:49.169987+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T13:04:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:14.464268+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:14.464268+00:00","content_hash":"bb8e10696de75ea7cf685c15db4b6fc53840ae6fa0b249874eafce8835cec3b4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}